    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></math> represents adjacent vertices of a regular polygon of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> sides and if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to",
